session.assistantText:
Verified: the server serves the file over its own authenticated endpoint, and a card-embedded `<video>` resolves against the same origin, so it plays inline.

```schemaJson
{
  "componentName": "Page",
  "state": {},
  "methods": {},
  "children": [
    {
      "componentName": "TinyCard",
      "children": [
        {
          "componentName": "h4",
          "children": "assets/sample.mp4"
        },
        {
          "componentName": "video",
          "props": {
            "src": "/api/file?path=%2Fdsh%2Fworkspace%2Finline-video-playback%2Fassets%2Fsample.mp4",
            "width": "100%",
            "height": "360",
            "controls": true,
            "autoplay": false,
            "preload": "metadata"
          }
        },
        {
          "componentName": "Text",
          "props": {
            "text": "文件路径：/dsh/workspace/inline-video-playback/assets/sample.mp4（1128375 字节，video/mp4，由会话内鉴权接口 /api/file 提供）"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
